{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Monster Slayers Incorporated, you play as the manager of a monster-hunting guild. Max out your KPIs in your insatiable quest for the highest quarterly returns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Build your team -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire heroes from a range of different class options, each with its own equippable weapon types and promotion trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/hero_hiring.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Embark on Quests -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sign quest contracts and navigate parties of heroes through monster-infested territories. Pick up treasure and encounter special events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/quest_boarding.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/stage_moving.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Slay Monsters -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring unique combat that combines elements of autobattlers and tactical RPGs. Position your heroes according to different weapon attack patterns. Use items or modify equipment between rounds to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/combat1.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/combat2.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different monster types in each location introduce new strategies and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Expand your Guild -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In between quests, take on research projects to unlock new hero classes and items. Build new facilities or upgrade existing ones to give your teams the best employee benefits that gold can buy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753810?t=1747866623","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753810?t=1747866623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/8856ee77cf93435b5330bcbc0d9f24ce51dca128/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747866623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/8856ee77cf93435b5330bcbc0d9f24ce51dca128/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747866623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Monster Slayers Incorporated, you play as the manager of a monster-hunting guild. Max out your KPIs in your insatiable quest for the highest quarterly returns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Build your team -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire heroes from a range of different class options, each with its own equippable weapon types and promotion trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/hero_hiring.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Embark on Quests -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sign quest contracts and navigate parties of heroes through monster-infested territories. Pick up treasure and encounter special events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/quest_boarding.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/stage_moving.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Slay Monsters -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring unique combat that combines elements of autobattlers and tactical RPGs. Position your heroes according to different weapon attack patterns. Use items or modify equipment between rounds to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/combat1.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/extras/combat2.gif?t=1747866623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different monster types in each location introduce new strategies and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Expand your Guild -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In between quests, take on research projects to unlock new hero classes and items. Build new facilities or upgrade existing ones to give your teams the best employee benefits that gold can buy.</p>","developers":["IslandWare"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753810/7eedeb00fea2da33c5c4009a820197466cba658c/header.jpg?t=1747866623","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Monster Slayers Incorporated","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 650M equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["IslandWare"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"bann